{
  "id": "DEU.27",
  "number": "27",
  "bookId": "DEU",
  "reference": "Giipkeata Diigheanda 27",
  "verseCount": 26,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "27",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "DEU 27"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "27",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Diigheanyeeka sing'oorsa badahuuka lagheanga",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 27:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean Musa sea gweargwa Israeli goorgweaksa buuneeda, nea gwayeesha, “Oang'waanya digheanyeeka sean earukuneegwa askweareani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.27.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.27.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 27:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea eaweeda eakghaawi Yordani ak ghoahiti ng'eanyiida goonyi NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEATAANG'U, gaymiinda lagheanga hees, ak gimuuwi aba hideeda; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.27.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.27.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 27:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ak gayng'oorsiina badayda ng'asheega sean bea diigheanyeeksu, iiniighaawi ak guwi jeeda ng'eanyiida gulda eanooga ea maleeda, gawuurji gida heeleesiindaneey NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEETA ghweanigaagu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.27.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.27.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 27:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abeeda nea niighaawi Yordani, gaymiinda lagheang'su, gawuurji gidearukuteaydaneey askweareani; aba uhuuda giijeeda Ebali, ak gaymuuwa aba hideeda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.27.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.27.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 27:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak aba hoowa gaydeeksiina heeda wagiida NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEATAANG'U, heeda wagiida bea lagheanga; adiidu giyiini badayda gidawas gharinyeanda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.27.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.27.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.27.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.27.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 27:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gaydeeksiina NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEATAANG'U heeda wagiida aba lagheanga meenyarjeaweada; ak gajadaw NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEATAANG'U haleanjeeda ghadooweeda sighwarda; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.27.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.27.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 27:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ak gajadayda haleanjeeda ghadooweeda bea hoyyoo, ak gajaga aba hoowa; ak gayhoosana aba madeeda NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEATAANG'U. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.27.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.27.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 27:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gayng'oorsiina badayda lagheanga ng'asheega sean bea diigheanyeeksu nea giidajiidi.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.27.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.27.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 27:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.27.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.27.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 27:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Hean gwayeesha Musa ea ashoohoodiga hees buuneesean bea Israeli, Asiinda ak ghoaleaydiit, Ea Israeli: Askweareani noowooschi fuga NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEATAANG'U. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.27.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.27.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 27:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gaysisiina mureeda ng'asheega ghuuta NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEATAANG'U, nea giing'waanyi diigheanyeekaaschi ea ng'asheagaaschi earukuneey askweareani.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.27.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.27.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Mooshteayda fuga mandeawana mureeda",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 27:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.27.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.27.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 27:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak goobalool buuneeda aba eaweedida, ak gwayeesha, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.27.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.27.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 27:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iyoakghaawi Yordani, gayghamiinaada fiisu aba uhuuda giijeeda Gerisimu ak ghoadaw buuneeda ghawooda: Simeoni, ea Lawi, ea Yuda, ea Isaka, ea Yosefu, ea Benjamini. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.27.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.27.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 27:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gayghamiinaada fiisu aba uhuuda Giijeeda Ebali aba mooshteayda: Rubeni, ea Gadi, ea Asheri, ea Sabuloni, ea Dani, ea Naftali. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.27.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.27.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 27:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea fuga Lawi gaygwarukusa buuneeda sean bea Israeli nea goojuur:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.27.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.27.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 27:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.27.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.27.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 27:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“‘Gagasa eamwaashta siida sina aseecheeka lagheanga ghana gharinga was munyinda aba heeda NG'UTAMIIDA was gadiyeeda geatinga gearnoocheanda, ak ghamiinda aba makcheameeda.’ Ak gaygwayi buuneeda sean, ‘Amin.’",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.27.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.27.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 27:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.27.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.27.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 27:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“‘Gagasa eamwaashta gilinyoo gafool ghwaan ea ghaamwat’. Ak gaygwayi buuneesean, ‘Amin’.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.27.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.27.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
