          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“‘Gajeamwaashta siida nyooh ghaghwan gitoobiiwsa rabascheanda, ea bananeeda ea masinung'weanda.’ Ak gaygwayi buuneesean, ‘Amin.’",
          "type": "text",
