              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“‘Gajeamwaashta siida nyooh gwaluudayi gatmooda ghwaan, aba gideaba nijaat eaghwada gatmooda ghwaan’. Ak gaygwayi buuneesean, ‘Amin.’",
          "type": "text",
